          "filename": "Mathematics (cryptography) on a blackboard.jpg",
          "caption": "A photo of a traditional blackboard showing some mathematics written in chalk. In subject in mathematics is cryptography. The specific topic is Diffie-Hellman key exchange, which is used to establish a secret between two people (called Alice and Bob) in public. The calculation shows how a man-in-the-middle attack can be conducted by someone (called Mallory) who can manipulate messages that Alice and Bob send to one another. The chalk board is located in Maynooth University's Physics Hall.",
